#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<strong>Founded in 2009 by a practitioner who had seen what conventional "
"executive search gets wrong, Zenith was designed from the start to serve "
"organizations where leadership quality is a strategic variable; not a "
"staffing question.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zenith 由一位深谙传统高管寻访之弊的从业者于 2009 年创立，从一开始就致"
"力于服务那些把领导力质量视为战略变量、而非人员配置问题的组织。</strong>"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<strong>Governance-grade candidates with the right sectoral expertise, "
"independence profile, and stakeholder credibility for your board "
"composition. We identify leaders who bring more than experience: they bring "
"judgment, perspective, and the ability to contribute meaningfully at board "
"level. Through a discreet and highly targeted approach, we connect you with "
"profiles that strengthen governance, support strategic oversight, and fit "
"the specific expectations of your organization.</strong><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>具备治理水准的候选人，拥有适合您董事会构成的行业专长、独立性和利益相"
"关方公信力。我们识别不只是有经验的领导者：他们带来判断力、视角以及在董事会层"
"面作出实质贡献的能力。通过审慎且高度定向的方式，我们为您连接能够强化治理、支"
"持战略监督并契合贵组织具体期望的人选。</strong><br/>"

