#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_6
msgid ""
"<strong>Lumix Energy Technologies</strong> is a London-headquartered SaaS "
"company providing AI-driven grid intelligence software to distribution "
"system operators across Europe. Founded in 2019, the company has grown to "
"€38M ARR and 180 employees following a €95M Series C in 2025. Its platform "
"is deployed in 9 countries and processes over 2 billion grid data points per "
"day."
msgstr ""
