#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_10
msgid ""
"We are currently accepting spontaneous applications from skilled "
"professionals in various fields. Our agency specializes in finding top-notch "
"candidates for our clients across multiple industries, including (but not\n"
"                                                limited to):"
msgstr ""
"目前，我们正在接受各领域专业人士的自行申请。我们的机构专门为多个行业的客户寻"
"找顶尖候选人，包括（但不\n"
"限于）："

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_4
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_6
#: model_terms:hr.job,website_description:headhunter.hr_job_7
msgid ""
"We are very picky. Only 1% of candidates gets chosen by our team members. "
"It's because we serve the most demanding companies on the market."
msgstr ""
"我们非常挑剔。只有 1% 的候选人能被我们团队选中，因为我们服务的是市场上要求最"
"严苛的公司。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_home
msgid "We find leaders others can't even reach."
msgstr "我们能找到别人甚至无法接触到的领导者。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We identify every relevant candidate globally: employed, passive, and off-"
"market; through network, research, and outreach."
msgstr ""
"我们在全球范围内识别每一位相关候选人：在职的、被动的、非公开市场的；通过人"
"脉、研究和主动触达。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We specialize in roles that shape organizations at their core; not middle "
"management, but the people who define <strong>culture</strong>, "
"<strong>strategy</strong> and <strong>competitive edge</strong>."
msgstr ""
"我们专注于从核心塑造组织的职位；不是中层管理，而是定义<strong>文化</strong>、"
"<strong>战略</strong>和<strong>竞争优势</strong>的人。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We track retention at 12, 24, and 36 months. If a placement doesn't work, we "
"want to understand why and we've built our process around preventing it."
msgstr ""
"我们追踪 12、24 和 36 个月的留任情况。如果某次猎聘不成功，我们想弄清原因，并"
"已围绕预防这种情况构建了我们的流程。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We work exclusively with huge organizations that hold complexity as a "
"competitive advantage; sectors where leadership quality is non-negotiable."
msgstr ""
"我们只与将复杂性视为竞争优势的大型组织合作；在这些行业，领导力质量不容妥协。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We work exclusively with organizations that hold complexity as a competitive "
"advantage: sectors where leadership quality is non-negotiable."
msgstr ""
"我们只与将复杂性视为竞争优势的组织合作：在这些行业，领导力质量不容妥协。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"We work exclusively with organizations that hold complexity as a competitive "
"advantage; sectors where leadership quality is non-negotiable."
msgstr ""
"我们只与将复杂性视为竞争优势的组织合作；在这些行业，领导力质量不容妥协。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When a candidate reaches the <b>First Interview</b> stage, the system "
"automatically emails them a link to the\n"
"            recruiter’s calendar to book a meeting."
msgstr ""
"当候选人进入 <b>初试</b> 阶段时，系统会自动向其发送一封包含招聘人员\n"
"            日历链接的邮件，以便预约会议。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "您想与我们讨论您的 Odoo 配置，或者走得更远吗？"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "您可以在主仪表板上访问 Odoo 数据库中安装的每一个应用。"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can generate sales orders directly from a job position or manually link "
"opportunities, sales orders, and\n"
"                    job positions. This flexibility ensures that regardless "
"of your workflow or any unique exceptions, your data\n"
"                    remains accurately connected"
msgstr ""
"您可以直接从工作岗位生成销售订单，也可以手动关联商机、销售订单和工作岗位。这"
"种灵活性确保无论您采用何种工作流程或存在何种特殊例外，数据都能准确关联"

#. module: headhunter
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:headhunter.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Talent Acquisition\n"
"                    package and select the relevant checkbox"
msgstr ""
"您没有导入演示数据？现在仍可导入。前往应用 &gt; 行业 &gt; 升级您的“人才招聘”"
"套餐，并勾选相应复选框"

